WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.501 --> 00:00:03.629
I am happy!

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:08.967
I know myself!

00:00:09.593 --> 00:00:14.098
I am not personally
responsible for anything.

00:00:16.934 --> 00:00:18.977
Can I just apologize
about what I look like?

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:20.354
Uh, I didn't have any time
to change.

00:00:20.354 --> 00:00:21.563
I had to, like, run here

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:23.482
straight from my dad's
worst nightmare.

00:00:23.982 --> 00:00:25.776
The show is still
gonna be filled with

00:00:25.776 --> 00:00:27.111
21st century cynicism,

00:00:27.111 --> 00:00:29.321
the self-objectification
encouraged by social media,

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:30.948
the late capitalist
co-option

00:00:30.948 --> 00:00:32.199
of the queer aesthetic.

00:00:32.199 --> 00:00:33.200
I'm kidding.
Can you imagine?

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:38.038
This is my story.

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:39.581
I'm not into
conspiracy theories.

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:40.916
Not because I don't think
they're true.

00:00:40.916 --> 00:00:42.126
Get him!
No, I'm kidding.

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.711
People are so critical of
young people at the moment.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:46.422
Young people are all
so desperate

00:00:46.422 --> 00:00:47.339
to play the victim,

00:00:47.339 --> 00:00:49.425
and I take that
extremely personally.

00:00:49.425 --> 00:00:50.926
I came here
to raise awareness.

00:00:50.926 --> 00:00:52.010
I haven't decided of what.

00:00:52.803 --> 00:00:56.306
Sex is really where I come
into my own as an actor.

00:00:56.306 --> 00:00:57.224
Wow!

00:00:57.224 --> 00:00:58.684
I'm actually just
very interested

00:00:58.684 --> 00:01:01.311
in the layered,
poetic symbolism of anal.

00:01:01.603 --> 00:01:02.604
That's a poem I wrote.

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:05.941
I do this as representation.

00:01:05.941 --> 00:01:08.110
You know I'm one of
the first ever Jewish people

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:09.111
to try stand-up comedy?

00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:12.364
This is the first song
I, like, ever wrote,

00:01:12.364 --> 00:01:14.658
so it might be a bit
pretentious or adolescent.

00:01:14.658 --> 00:01:16.618
But it's just a song about
my lived experiences

00:01:16.618 --> 00:01:17.870
being a twenty-something

00:01:17.870 --> 00:01:20.622
and growing up in this
increasingly scary time.

00:01:26.378 --> 00:01:27.254
Tonight

00:01:29.631 --> 00:01:31.133
I'm young tonight

00:01:31.759 --> 00:01:33.302
And I like to start
with some singing.

00:01:33.302 --> 00:01:34.845
No, we don't have time.

